        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further meet The client requirements, our company's can focus on providing a solution that utilizes our company's green hosting capabilities and digital sobriety practices, ensuring that the environmental impact of our proposed solution is minimized." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, our company's can offer a sustainable solution that not only meets but also supports The client goals of limiting environmental footprint and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We propose an artificial-intelligence assistance solution designed to improve productivity and the quality and reliability of work for Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' professionals. We hybrid delivery model combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, adapted to fit the client's needs, including a pilot phase on one office or one mission line. During the Framing phase, We will pay particular attention to confidentiality, existing production tools, and seasonality of workload." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We solution architect and project director will work closely with the client's to define the project scope and objectives. The Design phase will involve We engineers and data scientist designing a tailored Atelier platform to meet the client's specific requirements, respecting constraints regarding professional secrecy, auditor independence, and data sovereignty. a tailored Atelier platform median latency is 1.3 seconds and p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds for common queries, meeting the response time requirement. We can scale horizontally to handle peak loads and will ensure that the hosting tier chosen provides the necessary throughput and redundancy to sustain performance during seasonal peaks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We business tool integration capabilities include connectors and adapters for various systems, such as accounting-production and payroll software, and We have a delivery partner, Ligeo Conseil, to facilitate these integrations. We will deploy a tailored Atelier platform on a suitable hosting tier that ensures high availability and redundancy, such as the Sovereign tier provided by OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and offers EU-only, renewable-powered infrastructure. This setup meets performance, integration, and security requirements while respecting sovereignty and environmental constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3, encryption at rest using AES-256, and strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation. We are compliant with GDPR delivery and have experience with professional secrecy. To fully comply with the client's requirements, We will ensure that We solution maintains data sovereignty, protects sensitive data, and provides a complete audit trail and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We respect professional secrecy, auditor independence, and anti-money-laundering obligations, as demonstrated by We contractual experience and regulatory compliance context. We is required to comply with legal retention obligations for accounting documents, ensuring strict respect for professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data. The budget allocated to the project is €220,000 over 3 years, which is well within We normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We will ensure that We costs are controlled, aiming for a gross margin between 25% and 35%. We target is to achieve a gross margin between 25% and 35% by favoring cost-efficient tiers and models, such as the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, while preserving an acceptable margin. We proposed AI components include Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to improve productivity and quality of work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) core approach allows every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, citing passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and limiting unsupported generation. We can fine-tune We models using the client's specific data, with defined data use terms and compliance function involvement. For explainability, We features include source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and logged interactions for a posteriori audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Human oversight is built into the workflow, where the assistant proposes and the professional validates and signs. We have two model options: a Sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) that is fully auditable but has somewhat lower raw performance on complex tasks, and top-tier proprietary models (via API) with higher performance but lower internal transparency. We will ensure We proposed solution meets the client's environmental requirements by leveraging We existing capabilities, including We EcoVadis Silver rating and published trajectory to reduce carbon footprint intensity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budget constraints  The budget allocated to the project is, as an indication, €220,000 over 3 years. The annual operating cost must remain controlled. As Cabinet Vauclair & Associés is an SME, the titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service.  8. Environmental constraints  Cabinet Vauclair & Associés wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and to rely, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure.  9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We partnership with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud in the EU region ensures that We infrastructure relies on renewable energy. We practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, minimizing We environmental footprint. By combining these elements, We offer a comprehensive solution that addresses multiple client requirements and constraints related to productivity, quality, reliability, explainability, data sovereignty, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We approach is designed to deliver a high-quality solution while controlling annual operating costs, meeting the expected quality of service within the allocated budget of €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

